  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nYAR is a fully-fledged open-world RPG. Embark on a heartfelt journey inspired by Boreyian myths and legends, filled with vibrant and unforgettable adventures, uncover the mystery behind the attempt to conquer the noble Boreyian people.<p></p>\n<p>Experience a magical world and the spirit of the Boreyians! Help the Elders and free the land from evil!</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete captivating quests crafted with heart and soul.\n</li><li>Will you become a valiant Warrior or a wise Mage? Your faction choice will shape your story’s development.\n</li><li>Discover secrets and ancient artifacts as you explore vast lands.\n</li><li>Visit eerie dungeons in search of treasures.\n</li><li>Traverse forests, fields, lakes, swamps, icy mountains, scorched woods, lava lands, and numerous dungeons.\n</li><li>Encounter legendary characters from Eastern European folklore and mythology.\n</li><li>Create weapons and armor, practice Alchemy, Cooking, Blacksmithing, Magic Crafting, and many other professions.\n</li><li>Learn new skills and abilities with a unique and engaging combat system.\n</li><li>Utilize melee weapons, bows, crossbows, scrolls, spells, and enchantments.\n</li><li>Level up your character and enhance their attributes.\n</li><li>Pray to the Gods for blessings and gifts.\n</li><li>Master the art of fishing.\n</li><li>Play the card game “Koshun,” participate in fistfights, and compete in archery contests.\n</li></ul>\n",
